WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
One issue. Every handoff. An illustrative maintenance workflow.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
An operator reports an observed issue for a registered machine.

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
The maintenance head assigns an eligible technician.

00:13.000 --> 00:19.000
The assigned technician records findings, evidence, human RCA, actions and a separate restoration time.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
The head approves or returns the submission. The head or supervisor closes approved work separately.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Fixed-date calendar work needs head release. The assistant uses approved references. People decide.
